1
00:00:00,187 --> 00:00:02,517
(Sheldon:)You guys stink.

2
00:00:03,724 --> 00:00:05,694
(Bernadette:)Sorry I flipped out on you.

3
00:00:05,693 --> 00:00:07,393
(Bernadette:)I think it's just hormones.

4
00:00:07,394 --> 00:00:08,894
(Raj:)I think you were mean
before you were pregnant,

5
00:00:08,896 --> 00:00:10,026
(Raj:)but it's fine.

6
00:00:11,732 --> 00:00:14,602
(Raj:)So, uh, instead of
cleaning out the room,

7
00:00:14,602 --> 00:00:17,002
(Raj:)why don't we just decide
on a theme for the nursery?

8
00:00:17,004 --> 00:00:18,474
(Bernadette:)Does it really need one?

9
00:00:18,472 --> 00:00:20,042
(Raj:)Of course it does.

10
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,010
(Raj:)Didn't your baby room
have a theme?

11
00:00:22,009 --> 00:00:24,039
(Bernadette:)Well, it doubled
as my dad's office,

12
00:00:24,044 --> 00:00:25,914
(Bernadette:)and he was a cop,
so I guess the theme was

13
00:00:25,913 --> 00:00:28,443
(Bernadette:)bloody homicide photos.

14
00:00:28,449 --> 00:00:32,519
(Raj:)Oh. Mine was
Winnie the Pooh.

15
00:00:32,519 --> 00:00:35,459
(Raj:)But anyway...

16
00:00:35,456 --> 00:00:37,686
(Raj:)why don't we just
take a step back

17
00:00:37,691 --> 00:00:38,861
and start with a color?

18
00:00:38,859 --> 00:00:40,529
(Raj:)Right? There are
so many amazing ones.

19
00:00:40,527 --> 00:00:43,497
(Raj:)Red, blue, green, purple...

20
00:00:43,497 --> 00:00:45,127
(Bernadette:)Are you just gonna name
all the colors?

21
00:00:45,132 --> 00:00:48,302
(Raj:)Well, not now.

22
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,540
I don't care what color
the room is.

23
00:00:51,538 --> 00:00:53,538
(Raj:)Okay, well, I'm just
trying to help you.

24
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:59,020
(Bernadette:)Well, you're not,
so just drop it!

